From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AkaraChen <akarachen@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 09:30:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] acpc: agent slash commands in the composer

In acpc mode the slash popup lists the commands the ACP agent advertises
(acpc/availableCommands/updated). Choosing one, or typing any name the
TUI does not know, sends the text to the agent as a prompt. Agent
commands replace same-named built-ins except the session lifecycle ones.

Built-ins that depend on Codex's own runtime, account or services are
hidden in acpc mode.
